<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1JN" style="id">- Melo New Testament Latin</book>
  <para style="h">1Waannisa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Waannisa xaafeez Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Waannisa</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Wan.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Waannisa xaafeez Tiina Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt">Gelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Hawaare Waannisa xaafeez tiina kiitay, nam77ii aafe qofita aykkeeza. Yeykka nabbabizitay Xoossay e na7a Yesuus Kiristtoosar pettipettithii yezoday garkk minthathodayisinnee ye pettipettitha dhabisiza worddo timirttaypp haakkoday garkk unttan qopisodayisii. Ye wode denddeez worddo timirttay, «Xoossii benttowa ayyana alame medheeza. Yha benttiz alamannee nu asetitha Xooss medhdhekka gishos iita. Ma yha benttiz alamannee nu asetithay nu ayyana qohodayisinnee tunisodayis danda7ooya» yeegii taamarssiza. Yeya guussay, tiina, Yesuusa as maaqqii ye7ekkaya. Nam7anthay, pettii as fa ayyana tunisekka yezar fa ashor nagara oothodayis danda7iza yeegiza.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yeyi gishos, Waannisa fa kiitayid, Yesuusa as maaqqiza kaddiza oonkka Xooss na7a baaya (4:2-3). Ma Xoossapp yelintteez oonkka ubba wode nagarara yezoowa (3:6) yeegii xaafeeza.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ye worddo asitamaaritay, «Atotithi guussay, yha sa7a yessis un77inttopp kezii wallo kess guus» yeegiza. Yeyil afa gujjii, «Iitannee lo77o shaakkii aykithi maaqqin, ma hara as siiqo maaqqin atotithar abikka helithiza baz baaya» yeegiza.</para>
  <para style="ip">Xaafay yha timirtta ixxii, «Yesuus Kiristtoosa folo as. Yesuusa ammanizayinnee Xooss siiqizitay ubbay fa gancce pettay pettayir siiqinttodayis beeziza» yeegii odeeza.</para>
  <para style="iot">1 Waannisa kiitay aykkeez qofita</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelo <char style="ior"><ref loc="1JN 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Poo7onnee dhuma <char style="ior"><ref loc="1JN 1:5-2:29">1:5—2:29</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xooss na7itannee daabuloosa na7ita <char style="ior"><ref loc="1JN 3:1-24">3:1-24</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Tumannee worddo <char style="ior"><ref loc="1JN 4:1-6">4:1-6</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Siiqo ooso <char style="ior"><ref loc="1JN 4:7-21">4:7-21</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Gamiz ammano <char style="ior"><ref loc="1JN 5:1-21">5:1-21</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1JN 1"/>
  <para style="s1">De7o qaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 1:1"/>Tiinapp aykkii yez, de7o qaalay bagga nu yinttis xaafiza. Yha de7o qaalay nu nu hayer si7eez, nu aafer be7eez, nu kusher aykkeezaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:1">Wan. 1:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1JN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 1:2"/>Ye de7o inggizay qonccin, nuunii eza bi7ii, ebaz markkattiza. Ade kale yezay nuus qoncceez, medhina de7obagga yinttis ododa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:14">Wan. 1:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1JN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 1:3"/>Nuura yinttis pettipettithii yezoday garkk nuunii be7eezanannee si7eezana yinttis ododa. Nu pettipettithay Adayranne e Na7a Yesuus Kiristtoosar wola. <verse eid="1JN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 1:4"/>Nu ufayssay folo maaqqoday garkk yhaya yinttis nu xaafoda.<verse eid="1JN 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xooss poo7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 1:5"/>Nuunii eepp si7ii, yinttis odiza kiitay: «Xoossii poo7o; ezar dhuma yesha baaya» yeegizaya. <verse eid="1JN 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 1:6"/>Nuus ezar pettipettithii yeza yeegttar nu dhuma yeziko, nuunnii worddotiza. Tumakka nuur baaya. <verse eid="1JN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 1:7"/>Zini E poo7o yezay garkk, nuukka poo7o yeziko, nuus woli gancce pettipettithii yeza. E Na7a, Yesuusa suuthay nagara ubbaypp nuna geeshshiza.<verse eid="1JN 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 1:8"/>Nuunii, nuur nagara baaya giiko nu nuna dooshshiza; nuur tumatithikka baaya. <verse eid="1JN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 1:9"/>Zini Xoossayis nu nagara buuxiko, E nu nagara atto godayisinnee nu qoho ooso ubbaypp nuna geeshshodayis, ammanintteezayannee Geeshsha. <verse eid="1JN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 1:10"/>Nuunii nagara oothekka giiko Xoossana worddo kessiza; e qaalaykka nuur baaya.<verse eid="1JN 1:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1JN 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosa nu afakaato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 2:1"/>Ta na7untho, nagara yi oothaamay garkk taanii yhaya yinttis xaafiza. Zini oonkka nagara oothiko Xooss Aday kantta nu afakkatay, eekka Xillay, Yesuus Kiristtoosa, yeza. <verse eid="1JN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 2:2"/>Nu nagaray Kiristtoosa baggar atto ginttinttiza. E nu nagara aadda baazin alame ubbay nagaras yarshshintteeza.<verse eid="1JN 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 2:3"/>Nuunii Xooss kiita naagiko, sidhe bayth, tuma nu eza eriza. <verse eid="1JN 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 2:4"/>Oonkka, «Taanii eza eriza» yeegttar, e azaza nagaam ixxiko ye athay worddo; tumatithii ezar baaya. <verse eid="1JN 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 2:5"/>Zini e qaalayis nu azazinttiza ubbayis Xoossayis yez siiqqay folo maaqqiza. Nuunii Xoossar yez yessayis yeyi paas tuma markka. <verse eid="1JN 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 2:6"/>Taanii, «Xoossar yeza» giz oonkka Kiristtoosa yezeezay garkk yezodayis beeziza.<verse eid="1JN 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ooroth azazo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 2:7"/>Ta siiqo ishuntho, taanii yinttis tiinapp yez azaza xaafinepp attin oroth kiita xaafaamii. Yeykka yi si7eez binii azaza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Wan. 13:34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1JN 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 2:8"/>Maaqqopp attin, Kiristtoosarannee yi yessayid tuma maaqqii yez, oroth azaza xaafiza. Dhumay hali7in, yhatti tuma poo7ay poo7iza.<verse eid="1JN 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 2:9"/>«Ta Poo7o yeza» giittar fa isha ixxiza oonkka, yhanno hellodayis dhuma yeza. <verse eid="1JN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 2:10"/>Fa isha qadhdhiza oonkka poo7o yeza. Ye athayir hara as dhubbizabaz baaya. <verse eid="1JN 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 2:11"/>Zini fa isha ixxiza oonkka dhuma yeza; dhumar yedhdhiza. Dhuma eez afa to7iseez gishos ana yhanigizako erooya.<verse eid="1JN 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 2:12"/>Ta na7untho, Kiristtoosa sunthay baggar yi nagaray atto ginttintteez gishos taanii yinttis xaapoda. <verse eid="1JN 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 2:13"/>Aduntho, tiinapp yezana, yi ereez gishos yinttis xaafoda. Yelagitayo, Xalahe yi gameez gishos yinttis xaafoda. <verse eid="1JN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 2:14"/>Na7untho, Xooss Ada yi ereez gishos yinttis xaafeeza. Aduntho, tiinapp yez eza yi ereez gishos yinttis xaafeeza. Na7untho, yi mino maaqqeez gishos Xooss qaalay yinttar yeza gishonnee Xalahena yi gameez gishos yinttis xaafeeza.<verse eid="1JN 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 2:15"/>Alame woy alame baz ubba dosipatte. Alame dosiza oonkka Xooss Ada dosooya. <verse eid="1JN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 2:16"/>Alamel yez ubbay, asho amotithii, aafes lo77iz baz amottithinnee miisher ceeqinttithii alamebazapp attin Xoossapp baaya. <verse eid="1JN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 2:17"/>Alamennee amottith ubbay aadhoda, zin Xooss shene poliza oonkka medhinas yessada.<verse eid="1JN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosana ixxizitaypp naagintto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 2:18"/>Ta na7untho, wode wurssithay ukkeeza. Kiristtoosa ixxizay tiinapp ye7odana yi si7eezay garkk hara attozin, yhattekka Eza ixxizitay gaamitay denddeeza. Yeyi gishos, wode wurssithay ukkeezaya yhayir nuunii eriza. <verse eid="1JN 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 2:19"/>Ye xizitay nu bagga maaqqekka gishos nu ganccepp kezeeza. Unttii nu bagga maaqqeezako nuura garzhii yezoda, zin unttapp oonkka nu baggapp baazay erinttoday garkk nu ganccepp kezeeza.<verse eid="1JN 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 2:20"/>Zini Kiristtoosa yinttan fa Geeshsha Ayyanar tizheeza; yeyi gishos yi ubbay ubba baz eriza. <verse eid="1JN 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 2:21"/>Tuma yi eriza gishonnee tumar aba worddokka baazaya yi eriza gishos taanii yinttis xaafinepp attin tuma yi eroowa gishos baaya.<verse eid="1JN 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 2:22"/>Yesuusana, Xooss dooreeza baaya gi kaddiza asaypp hara worddanchchay oonoo? Yeyigarkk as Kiristtoosa morkke. Na7a kaddiko Adakka kaddiza. <verse eid="1JN 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 2:23"/>Na7a kaddiza ooskka Ade baaya; ma Na7ayis markkattiz ooskka Ade yeza.<verse eid="1JN 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 2:24"/>Yeyi gishos, tiina yi si7eez qaala yi wozinayid miinthii naagoytta. Tiina si7eez qaalayid miinggii yeziko yinttis Na7ayirannee Adayira pettipettithii yezoda. <verse eid="1JN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1JN 2:25"/>Yhaykka Kiristtoosa nuus inggeez ufayisay medhina de7o.<verse eid="1JN 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1JN 2:26"/>Yinttan balithza asay gishos taanii yhaya yinttis xaafeeza. <verse eid="1JN 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1JN 2:27"/>Kiristtoosapp yi ekkeez Ayyanay yi gancce yezizay gishos hara asitamaare koshshooya. E yinttan ubba baz tamarssoda Ayyanay yinttan tuma tamaarssinepp attin worddo baaya. Yey gishos Geeshsha Ayyanay yinttan tamaarsseezay garkk Kiristtoosar yezoytta.<verse eid="1JN 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1JN 2:28"/>Yikkee, ta na7untho, E qoncciz wode nuunii yashsha baythinnee e maaqqii yi7iza gallas e tiina nu yeellataamaygarkk ezar yezoytta. <verse eid="1JN 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1JN 2:29"/>Kiristtoosa geeshsha maaqqeezana yi eriko geeshsha ooso oothiza ubbay Xoossapp yelintteeza maaqqeezana eroytta.<verse eid="1JN 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1JN 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Xooss na7ita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 3:1"/>Nuunii Xooss na7ita ginttinttii xeeginttod garkk Xooss nuna ab garkk doseezako bo7oytta. Nuunii tumakka Xooss na7ita. Yha alamay Xoossa erekka gishos nunakka erooya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:12">Wan. 1:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1JN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 3:2"/>Ta siiqo ishuntho, yhatti nuunii Xooss na7ita; nuunii haronttes ab hanodazako haga erinttekkaya. Zini Kiristtoosa qoncciz wode nuunii ezar yezodana eriza. E tuma yezana nuunii be7ada. <verse eid="1JN 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 3:3"/>Kiristtoosa be7ada gi ufayisar naagiza oonkka, Kiristtoosa geeshshi maaqqeezay garkk fana geeshshiza.<verse eid="1JN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 3:4"/>Nagara higge mentho maaqqeez gishos nagara oothiza ubbay Xooss higge menthiza. <verse eid="1JN 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 3:5"/>Kiristtoosa asay nagara dhabisodayis qoncceezana yi eriza; ezar nagara baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:29">Wan. 1:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1JN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 3:6"/>Yey gishos Kiristtoosar yez oonkka nagarara oothooya. Ma nagarara yez oonkka eza be7ekkaya woy erekkaya.<verse eid="1JN 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 3:7"/>Ta na7untho, yinttan oonkka balithippe. Kiristtoosa geeshsha maaqqeezay garkk geeshsh oothiza oonkka geeshshii. <verse eid="1JN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 3:8"/>Daabuloosa binipp nagara ootheez gishos nagara ubba wode oothiza oonkka Daabuloosa dabbo. Yeyi gishos, Xooss Na7ay Daabuloosa ooso dhabisodayis qoncceeza. <verse eid="1JN 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 3:9"/>Xoossapp yelintteez oonkka Xooss Ayyanay ezalli yez gishos E ubba wode nagarara oothooya. Xoossapp yelintteez maaqqeez gishos nagarara oothooya oothodayis danda7ooya. <verse eid="1JN 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 3:10"/>Xooss na7itaynnee Xalahe na7itay yez dummatithay yhayir erinttiza; geeshsha oothowazayinnee woy fa isha dosowa as Xooss Na7a baaya.<verse eid="1JN 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Woli dosoytta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 3:11"/>Sisapp yi si7eez kiitay, «Woli dosodayis beeziza» yeegiz kiita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Wan. 13:34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1JN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 3:12"/>Nuunii Qaa7eela garkk maaqqodayis beezooya. Qaa7eela Xalahe dabbo maaqqii fa isha wodheeza. E fa isha abis wodheennee? E oosay iita maaqqeez gishonnee e ishay oosay lo77o maaqqeez gishos wodheeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Medhe. 4:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="1JN 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 3:13"/>Ta ishuntho, yha alamay yinttan ixxiko malabaz giippete. <verse eid="1JN 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 3:14"/>Nuunii nu ishita dosiza gishos yhayiqopp de7o piinggeezana eriza. Fa isha dosowa oonkka yhayiqo kuya yeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:24">Wan. 5:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1JN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 3:15"/>Fa isha ixxiza oonkka shemppo wodhizaya. Ma shemppo wodhiz ooskka medhina de7o baazana yi eriza. <verse eid="1JN 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 3:16"/>Kiristtoosa fa shemppa nu gishos aathii inggeezayid siiqo abizako nuunii ereeza. Nuukka nu ishitay gishos nu shemppa aathii inggodayis beeziza. <verse eid="1JN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 3:17"/>Zini hara maaddodayis salo yez oonkka metintteezana bi7ittar, ees qadhinttaam ixxiko fa wozinayir Xooss dosiza godayis wayizii danda7ee? <verse eid="1JN 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 3:18"/>Ta na7untho, nuunii oosorannee tumatithar nu siiqo beezodayis beezizapp attin cere oda aaddar woy doona mal7itho aaddar siiqinttodayis beezooya.<verse eid="1JN 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossis ammanintto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 3:19"/>Yhay garakka tuma asita maaqqeezitannee Xooss tiina hiriga bayth ammaninttii shiiqodayis danda7izana eriza. <verse eid="1JN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 3:20"/>Nu wozinay null afa pirddiza baz maaqqikokka, Xoossii nu wozinaypp gita maaqqeez gishos E ubba baz eriza.<verse eid="1JN 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 3:21"/>Ta siiqo ishuntho, nu wozinay null afa pirddoowa baz maaqqiko nuna Xooss tiina yashiz baz baaya. <verse eid="1JN 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 3:22"/>Nuunii e azaza naagiza gishonnee eza ufayssiz abaz oothiza gishos nu woossiza ubba eepp ekkoda. <verse eid="1JN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 3:23"/>Kiristtoosa nuna azazeezay garkk Xooss Na7a Yesuus Kiristtoosa sunthayir ammanoday garkkennee woli siiqoday garkk Xoossii nuna azazeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Wan. 13:34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:12">15:12</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 15:17">17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1JN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 3:24"/>Xooss azaza naagiza oonkka Xoossar yeza; Xoossaykka ezar yeza. Xoossii nuus inggeez Geeshsha Ayyanay baggar E nuur yezana eriza.<verse eid="1JN 3:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1JN 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Tuma ayyanannee worddo ayyana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 4:1"/>Ta siiqo ishuntho, wordo nabitay alamel dendeez gishos ayyana ubba ammanippatte, zin yha ayyanttay Xoossappezakonnee harappezako paacii bo7oytta. <verse eid="1JN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 4:2"/>Xoossii Ayyana maaqqeezana yi yhayir eroda; «Yesuus Kiristtoosa as maaqqii asho ma77ii ye7eezana markkattiz» ayyana ubbay Xoossapp yi7iza. <verse eid="1JN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 4:3"/>Kiristtoosa as maaqqii ye7eezana ammanoowa ayyana ubbay Xoossapp baaya. Yeyi Kiristtoosar eqqinttiza ayyana. Yi ye ayyanay ye7odana tiina si7eeza; E hara attozin yhattekka alamel yeza.<verse eid="1JN 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 4:4"/>Ta na7untho, yi Xoossisii. Yi gancce yez Geeshsha Ayyanay alamel yez ayyaanaypp wolqqama maaqqeez gishos worddo nabita yi gameeza. <verse eid="1JN 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 4:5"/>Wordo nabitay yha alamay as maaqqeez gishos yha alamay bagga odiza; yha alamay asay u oda si7iza. <verse eid="1JN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 4:6"/>Nuunii Xoossisii; Xooss eriza oonkka nuna si7iza. Xoossis maaqqekkazitay nuna si7ooya. Nuunii tuma ayyanannee worddo ayyana shagii erizay yeyira.<verse eid="1JN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xooss siiqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 4:7"/>Ta siiqo ishuntho, siiqo Xoossapp maaqqeez gishos wolla siiqinttoda. Siiqiza oonkka Xooss na7a; E Xoossakka eriza. <verse eid="1JN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 4:8"/>Xoossii siiqo maaqqeez gishos siiqinttoowa oonkka Xooss erooya. <verse eid="1JN 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 4:9"/>Nuunii Kiristtoosa baggar de7o denggoday garkk Xoossii fa pettii Na7a yha alamayill dakkeeza. Xoossii nuna fa siiqa yeyir beezeeza. <verse eid="1JN 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 4:10"/>Tuma siiqo guussay yhaya: nuunii Xooss siiqeez gishos baazin Xooss nuna siiqeez gishonnee nu nagarayis yarshshinttii nuna maarodayis fa Na7a kiitteez gishosii.<verse eid="1JN 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 4:11"/>Ta siiqo ishuntho, Xoossii nuna yhay garkk siiqikko, nunkka woli siiqodayis beeziza. <verse eid="1JN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 4:12"/>Oonkka Xooss be7eezay baaya. Nuunii woli siiqiko Xoossii nuur yeza; e siiqaykka nuur folo maaqqiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:18">Wan. 1:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="1JN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 4:13"/>Xoossii fa Ayyana nuus inggeez gishos nuunii Xoossar yezannee eekka nuur yezana nu eriza. <verse eid="1JN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 4:14"/>Aday fa Na7a, yha alama ashshizaya udii azazeezana nuunii be7eezannee markkattiza. <verse eid="1JN 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 4:15"/>Yesuusa Xooss Na7a maaqqeezana ammaniza o ganccekka Xoossii yeza; eekka Xoossar yeza. <verse eid="1JN 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 4:16"/>Xoossii nuna siiqizana nuunii erizannee ammaniza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1JN 4:16">Xoossii siiqo. Siiqor yez oonkka Xoossar yeza; Xoossaykka ezar yeziza. <verse eid="1JN 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 4:17"/>Nu yessay alamel Kiristtoosa yezeezay garkk maaqqeez gishos pirdda gallas yashabayth e tiina shiiqayis eza siiqqay nuur folo maaqqiza. <verse eid="1JN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 4:18"/>Folo siiqo yashsha kessii olizapp attin siiqqor yashsha. Yashsha seerar pettipp yhanigiza gishos yashitiz athay siiqqay folo baaya.<verse eid="1JN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 4:19"/>Xoossii tiina nuna siiqeez gishos nuukka siiqoda. <verse eid="1JN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 4:20"/>Oonkka, «Xooss siiqiza» giittar fa isha ixxiko, E worddo. Abis giiko, bi7iza fa isha siiqoowa oonkka be7ekka Xoossa wayizii siiqodayis danda7ee? <verse eid="1JN 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 4:21"/>Kiristtoosa nuus inggeez kiitay yhaya; «Xooss dosiza oonikka fa isha siiqodayis beeziza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="1JN 4:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1JN 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Ammanor Alame gamith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 5:1"/>Yesuusa, E Kiristtoosa yeegii, ammaniza oonkka Xooss na7a. Ada siiqiza oonkka e Na7akka siiqiza. <verse eid="1JN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 5:2"/>Nuunii Xoossa siiqiza gishonnee e azaza naagiza gishos Xooss na7ita siiqizana eriza. <verse eid="1JN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 5:3"/>Xooss dosiza guussay, e azaza naago. E azazaykka deexo baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:15">Wan. 14:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1JN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 5:4"/>Xooss na7a maaqqeeza oonkka yha alama gamodayis danda7iza. Nuunii yha alama gamoday nu ammanayira. <verse eid="1JN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 5:5"/>Yesuusa Xooss Na7a maaqqeezana ammaniza as aaddapp attin hara yha alame gamodayis danda7izay oonoo?<verse eid="1JN 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosa bagga markkattith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 5:6"/>Yesuus Kiristtoosa xinqqata beeziz haatharannee fa yhayiqo beeziz suuthar ye7eeza. E, haatharannee suuthar ye7eenepp attin haath aaddar ye7ekkaya. Geeshsha Ayyanay tuma maaqqeez gishos yeyi tuma maaqqeezana markkattiza. <verse eid="1JN 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 5:7"/>Hayidzii markkitay yeza. <verse eid="1JN 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 5:8"/>Yeyititay, Ayyana, haathinnee suuthii. Yha hayidzitay markkatithay petto. <verse eid="1JN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 5:9"/>Nu as markkattitha ammaniza, Zini Xooss markkatithay asayisaypp loyth aadhiza. Xoossii fa Na7ayis markkatteez markkatithay yhaya. <verse eid="1JN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 5:10"/>Xooss Na7a ammaniza as wozinayid yha markkatithay yeza. Xooss ammanoowa oonkka Xoossii fa Na7ayis markkatteez markkatitha ammanekka gishos Xoosse worddo udiza.<verse eid="1JN 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 5:11"/>Yikkee, markkatithay yhay; Xoossii nuus medhina de7o inggeeza; ye de7aykka e Na7ayir yez yeegizaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:36">Wan. 3:36</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1JN 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 5:12"/>Xooss Na7ay yez ooskka de7o yeza. Xooss Na7ay baa ooskka de7o baaya.<verse eid="1JN 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Medhina de7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 5:13"/>Xooss Na7a ammaniza yinttis medhina de7o yezana yi eroday garkk yhay yinttis ta xaafeeza. <verse eid="1JN 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 5:14"/>Xooss shene garkk abikka eza nu woossiko, E si7izana nu ammaniza. <verse eid="1JN 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 5:15"/>Nuunii woossiza ubba E si7iza eriko, nuunii woossiza baz E inggodana eriza.<verse eid="1JN 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 5:16"/>Oonkka fa isha yhayiqos helthowa nagara oothodar bi7iko, Xooss ees woossodayis beeziza. Yhayiqo helithiza nagara ootheezayis Xoossii de7o inggoda. Yhayiqo helthiza nagara yeza. Taanii yinttan yeyis Xooss woossoytta gamii. <verse eid="1JN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 5:17"/>Iita ooso ubbay nagara, zin yhayiqo helthowa nagara yeza.<verse eid="1JN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 5:18"/>Xooss Na7ay Yesuus Kiristtoosa eza naagizay gishos Xooss na7a maaqqeez oonkka nagarara ubba wode yezowaza nuunii eriza. Xalahe eza qohodayis danda7ooya. <verse eid="1JN 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 5:19"/>Nuunii Xoossis maaqqeezannee yha kunth alamay Xalahes haarinttizana eriza.<verse eid="1JN 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 5:20"/>Nuunii tuma Xoossa eroday garkk Xooss Na7ay ye7eezannee nuus akaaka inggeezana nu eriza. Nuunii e na7a, Yesuus Kiristtoosarannee tuma Xoossar pettipettethi yeza. Yesuusa tuma Xoossinnee medhina de7o.<verse eid="1JN 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 5:21"/>Ta na7untho, eeqitayis goyinopp yi haakkoytta.<verse eid="1JN 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 5"/>
</usx>
